step Into the Riverglades
  when !zone "Riverglades"
  tip Fly from Ironforge to Lakeshire in Redridge, then follow the road north out of town and up through Blackrock Pass: it comes down into the western Riverglades by the Bristle Hills.
  zone Redridge Mountains
  zone Riverglades
  zone Redridge Mountains
  goto 44.8,8.9 "Blackrock Pass"
  zone Riverglades
  goto 16.0,68.5 "The western Riverglades"

step Turner's Logging Camp
  tip North up the road to the lumber camp. Halligan Turner runs it; his third job, the saplings, comes once his plant food is in.
  accept 94842                          -- Unsavory Plant Food
  accept 94931                          -- Stolen Saws

step The Bristle Hills
  tip West into the Bristle Hills: the Redridge gnolls camp on the slopes all the way from the hills west of the lumber camp to the pass you came in by. The stolen saw blades lie only in the western camps, near the pass.
  tip Careful: Snargl, an elite gnoll (level 40), roams the south-western camps: pull the gnolls away from him.
  collect 266897 x8 quest 94931.1       -- Saw Blade

step Meadowsbrook and the river
  tip Back south-west along the river: kill the Mudfin Warriors and Oracles on the banks for Benjy (they drop Halligan's heads) and the Jumbo Crawfish in the shallows for the shells. Curly, one of Halligan's lumberjacks, is stuck on the bank just north-west of the murlocs; Robbie's hat lies on the riverbank among them; the fresh manure is in the fields of Meadowsbrook, between the river and the farm. Ghostmaw, an elite (level 42), prowls the river: if he comes your way, back off and let him pass.
  collect 267266 x8 quest 94842.3       -- Mudfin Murloc Head
  collect 266157 x4 quest 94842.1       -- Jumbo Crawfish Shell
  collect 266156 x4 quest 94842.2       -- Fresh Manure

step Turner's Logging Camp
  tip North up the road to the lumber camp.
  turnin 94931                          -- Halligan Turner
  turnin 94842

step Farholde Keep
  tip On east along the road to Farholde Keep. Gretchen Mayberry, the gryphon master, stands at its western gate; Bertrand Ironbrow and Ember Bladewhisper are on the way in, Brother Lowley tends the wounded by the barracks, Demar Brant and Ashe Amberhall wait in the keep at the east end, and the inn is in the south of the walls.
  accept 95943                          -- Bertrand Ironbrow: Foreman's Plight
  accept 95156                          -- Ember Bladewhisper: Stuff 'Em and Stick 'Em
  accept 94881                          -- Ashe Amberhall: Curious Trinkets, for later in this guide
  accept 94879                          -- Scraps of Knowledge, for later in this guide
  accept 95330                          -- Cassandra Wheeler, by the inn: Love Thy Neighbor, for Turner's Logging Camp later in this guide

step The cathedral
  tip Sister Rowland keeps the old cathedral at the south-west corner of Farholde Keep. The bats roost in its upper floor; Marla Bell sells the holy candles beside it; the graves are in the chapel graveyard.
  tip Abbot Schuncke, an elite of level 53, stands in the cathedral: he leaves you be, so never attack him, and pull the bats away from him.
  accept 95603                          -- Bats in the Belfry

step Fly to Morgan's Vigil
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Morgan's Vigil"

