step Farholde Keep
  tip South across the plains to Farholde Keep: Ashe Amberhall and Demar Brant stand together in the keep at the east end, Ashe first, her news is what Brant's next orders wait on. With Sunnyglade saved, Tessa Dawnbright by the orchard and Brother Lowley by the barracks have work for you too.
  turnin 94881                          -- Ashe Amberhall
  turnin 94879
  accept 96081 optional                 -- Brother Lowley: twenty Mageweave Cloth, from Sunnyglade's cultists and the pirates; hand it in when you are back

step Tessa Dawnbright
  tip Tessa Dawnbright stands west of the inn, by the orchard: the apples hang on the trees around it.
  accept 95561                          -- Apple of My Eye
  collect 271431 x6 quest 95561.1       -- Fresh Apple
  turnin 95561
  accept 95913                          -- Fit for a Princess

